
flowchart LR
    MAIN["main<br/>always deployable<br/>tagged releases"] --> DEV["develop<br/>integration branch"]
    DEV --> F["feature/*<br/>one concern per branch"]
    DEV --> FIX["fix/*<br/>scoped to one defect"]
    DEV --> HOT["hotfix/*<br/>production only"]
    F --> DEV
    FIX --> DEV
    HOT --> MAIN
    DEV -->|"release/*"| MAIN
